{"id":"n38480-1-8","stage":5,"title":"기품 · 气度","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38480-1-8-1","ko":"이 궁전은 역대 왕들이 살던 궁전답게 매우 웅장하면서 고급스러워요.","zh":"这座宫殿不愧是历代国王居住的宫殿，极为宏伟且奢华。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"궁전은","meaning":"宫殿","explanation":"궁전：宫殿；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"궁전","audio":"/audio/da4b90bf0ca92eeb64e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34856","senseId":"1","lemma":"궁전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"역대","meaning":"历代，历届","explanation":"역대：历代，历届","readings":[{"term":"역대","audio":"/audio/86f15bb7537ca0f58500.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91846","senseId":"1","lemma":"역대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왕들이","meaning":"王","explanation":"왕：王；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"왕","audio":"/audio/6014abd1dab738e0d2f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66307","senseId":"1","lemma":"왕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살던","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"궁전답게","meaning":"宫殿","explanation":"궁전：宫殿；답：表示具有前面名词应有的特征或风范：“有……的样子、不愧是……”。；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"궁전","audio":"/audio/da4b90bf0ca92eeb64e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34856","senseId":"1","lemma":"궁전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매우","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"매우：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"매우","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61510","senseId":"1","lemma":"매우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웅장하면서","meaning":"雄壮，宏伟，壮阔","explanation":"웅장하다：雄壮，宏伟，壮阔；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"웅장하다","audio":"/audio/44798ed524fa3e8aedc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69826","senseId":"1","lemma":"웅장하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고급스러워요.","meaning":"高档，高级","explanation":"고급스럽다：高档，高级；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"고급스럽다","audio":"/audio/3ad6cd06dcf2c7ae483b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28075","senseId":"1","lemma":"고급스럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"da4b90bf0ca92eeb","term":"궁전","zh":"宫殿","audio":"/audio/da4b90bf0ca92eeb64e7.mp3","entryId":"34856","definition":"一国的国君生活的房子。","pronunciation":["궁전"]},{"id":"86f15bb7537ca0f5","term":"역대","zh":"历代，历届","audio":"/audio/86f15bb7537ca0f58500.mp3","entryId":"91846","definition":"从以前延续下来的许多代。","pronunciation":["역때"]},{"id":"6014abd1dab738e0","term":"왕","zh":"王","audio":"/audio/6014abd1dab738e0d2f9.mp3","entryId":"66307","definition":"在实行王位继承制的国家管理国家的人。","pronunciation":["왕"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"6226ddde2c49b372","term":"매우","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3","entryId":"61510","definition":"表示远远超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["매우"]},{"id":"44798ed524fa3e8a","term":"웅장하다","zh":"雄壮，宏伟，壮阔","audio":"/audio/44798ed524fa3e8aedc4.mp3","entryId":"69826","definition":"规模或气氛等十分巨大而有分量。","pronunciation":["웅장하다"]},{"id":"3ad6cd06dcf2c7ae","term":"고급스럽다","zh":"高档，高级","audio":"/audio/3ad6cd06dcf2c7ae483b.mp3","entryId":"28075","definition":"东西的品质很出色或品位很高。","pronunciation":["고급쓰럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7a2eb7c674433f09bf55.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38480-1-8-2","ko":"그러게요. 이 궁전을 통해 기품이 있는 왕실 생활을 엿볼 수 있겠어요.","zh":"是啊，通过这座宫殿，我们大概能够窥见王室那充满气派的日常生活了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게요.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"궁전을","meaning":"宫殿","explanation":"궁전：宫殿；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"궁전","audio":"/audio/da4b90bf0ca92eeb64e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34856","senseId":"1","lemma":"궁전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"통해","meaning":"通过，利用，使用","explanation":"통하다：通过，利用，使用；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"통하다","audio":"/audio/feb666c5640cabcc5d63.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58169","senseId":"10","lemma":"통하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기품이","meaning":"气度，气宇，气质","explanation":"기품：气度，气宇，气质；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기품","audio":"/audio/194187d3b8221dad8414.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38480","senseId":"1","lemma":"기품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왕실","meaning":"王室","explanation":"왕실：王室","readings":[{"term":"왕실","audio":"/audio/3097e091c9cf67899d9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68289","senseId":"1","lemma":"왕실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생활을","meaning":"生活","explanation":"생활：生活；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74183","senseId":"2","lemma":"생활","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엿볼","meaning":"窥伺，觊觎","explanation":"엿보다：窥伺，觊觎；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"엿보다","audio":"/audio/b95c246f63e0f6ef54e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14116","senseId":"3","lemma":"엿보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있겠어요.","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"da4b90bf0ca92eeb","term":"궁전","zh":"宫殿","audio":"/audio/da4b90bf0ca92eeb64e7.mp3","entryId":"34856","definition":"一国的国君生活的房子。","pronunciation":["궁전"]},{"id":"feb666c5640cabcc","term":"통하다","zh":"通过，利用，使用","audio":"/audio/feb666c5640cabcc5d63.mp3","entryId":"58169","definition":"在做某事时，以人或物体为媒介。","pronunciation":["통하다"]},{"id":"194187d3b8221dad","term":"기품","zh":"气度，气宇，气质","audio":"/audio/194187d3b8221dad8414.mp3","entryId":"38480","definition":"从人或事物中流露出的品格高尚、优秀的氛围。","pronunciation":["기품"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有；能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"3097e091c9cf6789","term":"왕실","zh":"王室","audio":"/audio/3097e091c9cf67899d9a.mp3","entryId":"68289","definition":"王的家庭。","pronunciation":["왕실"]},{"id":"6a739e74f8dfb7fb","term":"생활","zh":"生活","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3","entryId":"74183","definition":"谋生并维持生计。","pronunciation":["생활"]},{"id":"b95c246f63e0f6ef","term":"엿보다","zh":"窥伺，觊觎","audio":"/audio/b95c246f63e0f6ef54e1.mp3","entryId":"14116","definition":"等待或算计合适的时机。","pronunciation":["엳ː뽀다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]}],"audio":"/audio/229ecbde029f27f76fc8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":6.38,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38480","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":178,"sequenceScore":6.2067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，通过这座宫殿，我们大概能够窥见王室那充满气派的日常生活了。","金教授，听说这次您要在教育心理学领域开展一个新项目？","这座宫殿不愧是历代国王居住的宫殿，极为宏伟且奢华。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊，通过这座宫殿，我们大概能够窥见王室那充满气派的日常生活了。","这座宫殿不愧是历代国王居住的宫殿，极为宏伟且奢华。","金教授，听说这次您要在教育心理学领域开展一个新项目？"],"answer":0}]}
